{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11204180","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11204180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419001:":{"text":"砂の子どもよ、恐れを捨てて。","source_cn":"砂中的孩子，丢掉恐惧","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFEAD72DE9A58DCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419002:":{"text":"あなたのために子どもの頃の歌を歌ってあげる。","source_cn":"我会为你唱响童年的歌谣","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05ABF8032D2D8AAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419003:":{"text":"風に乗って舞い散る魂よ、もし迷ってしまったのなら、","source_cn":"随风飘零的灵魂，若你感到彷徨","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE33F6DD91C2418EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419004:":{"text":"歌声とともに帰っておいで。","source_cn":"随着歌声回来吧","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x813BF56C57919A14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419009:":{"text":"また会おう、我が友よ……","source_cn":"再见了，我的朋友……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADF4CE41FE0B9314","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419005:":{"text":"涙が疲れた魂を洗い流す。","source_cn":"泪水洗涤疲惫的灵魂","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC17362EE974C58F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419008:":{"text":"ありがとう、お母さん。","source_cn":"谢谢，母亲","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3E6B1F29D390D2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419007:":{"text":"うぅ……","source_cn":"呜呜……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5803DDBD679F7301","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419006:":{"text":"安らかな眠りにつかれますように。","source_cn":"愿你在归途中，有所依靠","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE3A053B6B4B55FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120418001:1":{"text":"君たちも儀式に参加しに来たのか？死者は誰だ？","source_cn":"你们也是来参加仪式的吗？逝者是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAED0F9B5681A3823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120418002:0":{"text":"死者って……ジャクソンのこと？","source_cn":"逝者……你是说，贾克松？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3523DB5D53E6F3E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120418003:1":{"text":"ジャクソンか……昔は儀式に参加してたんだが、今は安らかに眠る魂になってしまったのか……","source_cn":"贾克松，是他吗……曾经参加仪式的人，今天却要成为安眠的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68E7C1FE287A4B19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120418004:0":{"text":"すみません、ここで行われる儀式ってどういうものなんですか？私たちはババリアではないんですが、ジャクソンの遺書を持ってきたんです……","source_cn":"不好意思，请问，在这里举办的仪式是什么？我们虽然不是蛮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1028B93D6D8B583E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120418005:1":{"text":"俺たちは古くからの伝統である<style=\"highlight\">涙の儀式</style>の準備をしてるんだ。","source_cn":"我们在筹备非常传统、非常古老的<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BF564D3132761DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1120418005":{"text":"俺たちは古くからの伝統である<style=\"highlight\">涙の儀式</style>の準備をしてるんだ。","source_cn":"我们在筹备非常传统、非常古老的<style=highlight>泣祷仪式</style>，如果你们听说过的话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BF564D3132761DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120418006:1":{"text":"涙の儀式。それは……泣くことだ。そうすることで生者の心をなだめ、死者の魂を慰めるんだ。","source_cn":"泣祷——哭泣。放声大哭。以此来抚平生者的内心，慰藉逝者...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7288142101B2A39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120418007:1":{"text":"君たちにとってはごく普通のことかもしれないけど、俺たちにとっては特別で……恥とも言えるものなんだ。","source_cn":"这对于你们来说可能再普通不过，但是对于我们来说却很特殊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D4223FA1518F70A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120418008:1":{"text":"ババリアは意志の固さと不屈の精神をほまれとするから、泣くことは心を弱くする悪い習慣だとされてるんだ。一部の者は死者を重んじて密かに儀式を行うこともあるが、見つかったらやっぱり軽蔑されるだろう。","source_cn":"因为蛮血以坚毅不屈为荣，流泪是弱化内心的陋习。虽然少数...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD82A080213B311EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120418009:1":{"text":"だから、今日見たものはすべて秘密にしておいてくれ。","source_cn":"所以，请你们对今天看到的一切保密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4617189471955327","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120418010:0":{"text":"紹介してくれてありがとうございました。秘密は絶対に守ります。","source_cn":"谢谢你的介绍，我们一定会保护你们的秘密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67D99CF47628A83F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120418011:0":{"text":"さぁ、入ってくれ。「お母さん」の準備は整ってる。君たちの友人が安らかに眠れることを願うよ。","source_cn":"那么，请进吧，“母